                                                "sense_id": "4e1eb731-77ef-35b7-ae8f-23e95ade7623",
                                                "text": "The phrase, “tank meta”, is one that carries a lot of weight when it comes to MOBAs. These metas are generally characterized by tanky, unkillable behemoths dominating the meta and leaving any character that isn’t focused around raw DPS in the dust."
                                            },
